{"blocks":[{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Department for Work and Pensions ","tree_line_end":6,"tree_line_start":2},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" DECISION MAKING AND APPEALS (PART OF LEGAL GROUP) ","tree_line_end":10,"tree_line_start":7},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":14,"tree_line_start":11},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"Decision Makers Guide ","tree_line_end":18,"tree_line_start":15},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":21,"tree_line_start":19},{"depth":1,"role":"H2","text":"Volume 12 ","tree_line_end":25,"tree_line_start":22},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Amendment 37 – February 2018 ","tree_line_end":29,"tree_line_start":26},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":33,"tree_line_start":30},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":37,"tree_line_start":34},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"1. This letter provides details on Amendment 37 the changes have already been incorporated in to the Intranet and Internet versions of the DMG.  ","tree_line_end":43,"tree_line_start":38},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":48,"tree_line_start":44},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"2. PDF amendment packages are also available. These can be printed with the amended pages being reproduced in full. Each page will contain the amendment number in the footer.  ","tree_line_end":54,"tree_line_start":49},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":59,"tree_line_start":55},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"PDF amendment packages can be found on the Intranet at: ","tree_line_end":64,"tree_line_start":60},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":69,"tree_line_start":65},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"http://intralink/1/lg/acileeds/guidance/decision%20makers%20guide/index.asp\n ","tree_line_end":81,"tree_line_start":70},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":86,"tree_line_start":82},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" or on the Internet at the ‘Amdt Packages’ tab on the following link: ","tree_line_end":90,"tree_line_start":87},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":94,"tree_line_start":91},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"http://www.dwp.gov.uk/publications/specialist-guides/decision-makers-guide/\n ","tree_line_end":106,"tree_line_start":95},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":111,"tree_line_start":107},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Note: When printing PDF packages set the print properties to Duplex/Long Edge in order to produce double sided prints. ","tree_line_end":116,"tree_line_start":112},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":121,"tree_line_start":117},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"3. Amendment 37 affects the abbreviations and chapter 75.  The changes:  ","tree_line_end":127,"tree_line_start":122},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":130,"tree_line_start":128},{"depth":1,"role":"L","text":"• Chapter 75 - incorporate memo DMG 23/17 at 75166 and make minor amendments at 75364. ","tree_line_end":137,"tree_line_start":131},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"• Chapter 75 - incorporate memo DMG 23/17 at 75166 and make minor amendments at 75364. ","tree_line_end":137,"tree_line_start":132},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":140,"tree_line_start":138},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"4. If using a PDF amendment package remove the sheets as stated in the left hand column of the Remove and Insert table below and insert the new sheets as stated in the right hand column (note the record of amendments at the back of the Volume). ","tree_line_end":146,"tree_line_start":141},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":150,"tree_line_start":147},{"depth":1,"role":"Table","text":" \n \nRemove \nInsert \n \n \nAbbreviations \nAbbreviations \nAbbreviations (5 pages) \nAbbreviations (5 pages) ","tree_line_end":202,"tree_line_start":151},{"depth":2,"role":"TR","text":" \n ","tree_line_end":162,"tree_line_start":154},{"depth":3,"role":"TD","text":" ","tree_line_end":158,"tree_line_start":155},{"depth":4,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":158,"tre